{"id":3233,"slug":"3233-custom-directives-trong-vue-3","category":"Vue.js","subcategory":"Chuyên Sâu","level":"advanced","question_vi":"Custom directives trong Vue 3?","question_en":"Custom directives in Vue 3?","answer_vi":"Custom directive cho phép reuse DOM manipulation logic. Trong `<script setup>`:\n```javascript\n// vFocus — auto-focus element khi mount\nconst vFocus = {\n  mounted: (el) => el.focus()\n}\n\n// vTooltip với value\nconst vTooltip = {\n  mounted(el, binding) {\n    el.title = binding.value\n    el.style.cursor = 'help'\n  },\n  updated(el, binding) {\n    el.title = binding.value\n  }\n}\n```\n```vue\n<input v-focus />\n<span v-tooltip=\"'Hover me'\">?</span>\n```\nDirective hooks: `created`, `beforeMount`, `mounted`, `beforeUpdate`, `updated`, `beforeUnmount`, `unmounted`.","answer_en":"Custom directives allow reusing DOM manipulation logic. In `<script setup>`:\n```javascript\n// vFocus — auto-focus element on mount\nconst vFocus = {\n  mounted: (el) => el.focus()\n}\n\n// vTooltip with value\nconst vTooltip = {\n  mounted(el, binding) {\n    el.title = binding.value\n    el.style.cursor = 'help'\n  },\n  updated(el, binding) {\n    el.title = binding.value\n  }\n}\n```\n```vue\n<input v-focus />\n<span v-tooltip=\"'Hover me'\">?</span>\n```\nDirective hooks: `created`, `beforeMount`, `mounted`, `beforeUpdate`, `updated`, `beforeUnmount`, `unmounted`.","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Custom directive cho phép reuse DOM manipulation logic.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Trong <code>&lt;script setup&gt;</code>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// vFocus — auto-focus element khi mount\nconst vFocus = {\n  mounted: (el) =&gt; el.focus()\n}\n\n// vTooltip với value\nconst vTooltip = {\n  mounted(el, binding) {\n    el.title = binding.value\n    el.style.cursor = 'help'\n  },\n  updated(el, binding) {\n    el.title = binding.value\n  }\n}\" ari